----------------------------------------------\
\uc0\u55357 \u56538  How to Show During Demo\
----------------------------------------------\
1. Start both backends (`mvn spring-boot:run`)\
2. Start frontend (`npm start`)\
3. Open http://localhost:3000\
4. Log in as Admin (admin@wcs.com / admin123)\
5. Show CRUD on Products.\
6. Log in as Customer (any email/password).\
7. Add/remove products in the cart.\
8. Open http://localhost:8081/h2-console to show Product DB changes.\
9. Open http://localhost:8082/h2-console to show Customer DB changes.\
